      "practicalTipsEn": "High-speed trains reach Pingyao Gucheng Station in 30–35 minutes from Taiyuan South, ~3 hours from Xi'an North, and ~4 hours from Beijing West. Walking the old town streets is free, while entering Rishengchang, the City Wall, County Yamen, Confucian Temple, and 18 other monuments requires the 125 CNY 3-day combo pass (open 08:00–18:00 summer, 08:00–17:30 winter). Reserve half a day for a 15-minute taxi ride to Shuanglin Temple (35 CNY) and Zhenguo Temple (25 CNY) to experience all three components of UNESCO Site 812."
