      "practicalTipsEn": "Both the Xiling Society compound and China Seal Museum offer free admission (Tuesday-Sunday, 08:30-16:30; closed Mondays). Take a high-speed train from Shanghai Hongqiao to Hangzhou East (45-60 minutes), then Metro Line 1 to Longxiangqiao Station and walk along West Lake. In 2026, when purchasing Shoushan or Tianhuang stones, insist on a certified mineralogical report (NGTC/GTC) to distinguish genuine alluvial Tianhuang from heat-dyed simulants."
