        "Thematic spirit: Yangliuqing celebrates opulent North Chinese urban prosperity; Hang Trong unites Thang Long elegance with indigenous Mother Goddess devotional art (Five Tigers); and Dong Ho infuses agrarian warmth with biting social satire (Rat's Wedding)."
