        "On agricultural restructuring: Enforcement of Decrees 248/249 and the June 2026 transition to Decree 280 have accelerated Vietnam's shift away from fragmented smallholder aggregation toward consolidated orchards with farming logs, VietGAP/GlobalGAP certification, and compliant cold-storage networks."
