          "In Vietnam, the LFP battery market reached an estimated USD 118 million in 2025 and is projected to expand at a 33.4% compound annual growth rate (CAGR) to roughly USD 664.2 million by 2030. Demand is anchored by two segments: (1) electric two-wheelers, commercial fleets, and passenger EVs—supported by cell-to-chassis (CIIC) technical partnerships and LFP cell manufacturing ventures involving CATL and Gotion in Ha Tinh's Vung Ang Economic Zone; and (2) utility-scale LFP BESS installations mitigating solar and wind grid curtailment across Ninh Thuan, Binh Thuan, and the Central Highlands under Power Development Plan VIII."
